---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import OfferLink from '../components/OfferLink.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout title={SITE.title}>
  <article class="prose-wrap">
    <p class="kicker">For executive dads</p>
    <h1>Home AI systems that leave room for the people in the room.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Work already fills the calendar. The house needs tools that protect attention, not another dashboard that follows you to the dinner table.
    </p>
    <div class="stack">
      <p>
        The Presence Directory is a curated public list of home AI systems for executive dads. Each listing is one markdown file with a name, a url, a category, a price, and Presence Audit results. Nothing is listed until it has been reviewed.
      </p>
      <p>
        Presence is a form of stewardship. The people under your roof are not a side project. A system that earns a place here should help a father close the laptop and look up.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn" href="/listings">Browse listings</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/audit">Read The Presence Audit</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/submit">Submit a system</a>
    </div>
    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="empty-shelf">
      <h2 id="empty-shelf">The shelf is empty on purpose</h2>
      <p>
        There are no listings yet. This directory does not invent tools, scores, or testimonials. When a system has been audited, it will appear on the listings page.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="offer-heading">
      <h2 id="offer-heading">Work with Christopher</h2>
      <p>
        If you want help putting the house in order as an executive dad, this placeholder points to the current offer until a dedicated link is set.
      </p>
      <p><OfferLink /></p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
